# Welcome!

#### This short professional learning module introduces you to the concepts in **AI Foundations** (Semester 2) course— a curriculum where students code alongside AI to build real-world interactive projects.

#### This is a new, future-ready curriculum that offers students a chance to learn coding and computer science in a new way and the purpose of this module is to give you an understanding of what this new course is about. 

#### For a deeper dive into the skills and content of each unit, be sure to try the self-paced professional learning modules that accompany each unit. 
___

<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; width: 95%; margin: 20pt auto; padding: 0 5px;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/36211eedb3698751fa5523b4dde93351-image-1760467094025.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/7f813b0aec7d472e470f94eb91471aa1-image-1760466945803.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/ddb463a06ccc88f5d7390a1f841a0f31-image-1760467013014.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
</div>

___


#### **By the end of this professional learning module, you will be able to:**

* #### Introduce the foundaitonal concepts in the AI Foundations (Semester 2) course.
* #### Understand the basics of web applications and how they support interactive, AI-powered projects.
* #### Understand how to integrate AI tools and concepts into coding lessons to model responsible and creative AI use.


## Take Our Professional Learning Pilot Pre-Survey

#### Help us improve this professional learning unit by taking our pre-survey - it will take fewer than five minutes to complete.

